    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7NUKwz",
      "title": "Update AXGT token list entry for new Ethereum L1 contract",
      "author": "avimanyu786",
      "number": 1294,
      "body": "## Description\r\n\r\nUpdates the **AXGT** Superchain Token List entry to match the **current Ethereum mainnet** AxonDAO governance token deployment.\r\n\r\n- **L1 contract:** `0x6112C3509A8a787df576028450FebB3786A2274d`\r\n- **On-chain metadata:** `name` / `symbol` / `decimals` → `AXGT` / `AXGT` / `18` (aligned with `data.json` for CI)\r\n- **Removes** the previous L1 address and **Base** listing so we do **not** advertise stale or unverified L2 addresses; a follow-up PR can add Base (or other chains) once canonical bridged contracts exist\r\n- **Logo:** `logo.svg` from [MetaMask contract-metadata](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MetaMask/contract-metadata/refs/heads/master/icons/eip155%3A1/erc20%3A0x6112C3509A8a787df576028450FebB3786A2274d.svg) (256×256 SVG)\r\n- **Copy:** Short description aligned with [axondao.io](https://axondao.io/); `website` and `twitter` unchanged for discoverability\r\n\r\n**Why this replaces the existing `data/AXGT` row:** AxonDAO’s public posts document the token/migration context:\r\n\r\n- https://x.com/AxonDAO/status/2006737346377515285  \r\n- https://x.com/AxonDAO/status/2036512474694840581  \r\n\r\nThis PR only updates **off-chain** list metadata for bridge and wallet UIs; it does not move tokens or deploy contracts.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\nFrom repo root:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nnpx tsx ./bin/cli.ts validate --datadir ./data --tokens AXGT\r\n```\r\n\r\n(`optimism.tokenlist.json` was **not** edited; it is generated on merge.)\r\n\r\n## Additional context\r\n\r\n- **L1-only:** No Base / Optimism (or other chain) keys until there are real deployments to list.\r\n- **`nobridge`:** Not set; maintainers can request `nobridge: true` if Optimism Bridge app treatment should be excluded for this listing.\r\n\r\n## Metadata\r\n\r\n- **Token folder:** `data/AXGT/`\r\n- **Files:** `data.json`, `logo.svg`",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T11:23:49Z",
